            },
            "reviewBody": "it was great. I cooked it on my pellet grill.",
            "datePublished": "2019-01-14T02:36:07.310Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lisa Marie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "AMAZING!!!! Made this today for an early family Easter Dinner. Followed the directions with the exception of the bourbon, only because we are out. I used a spiral cut ham. Used about 1/2 the sauce and baked according to the hams direction. For the final 30 minutes of cooking I really coated the ham with the rest of the glaze and baked the remainder of the time uncovered. Like the suggestions, I really got the sauce into the slices with a BBQ brush. IT IS AMAZING!",
            "datePublished": "2015-04-04T08:48:23.743Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kellyda"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious! Followed the recipe exactly. Poured half over the ham before baking and the other half the last 15 minutes. Thank you for sharing.",
            "datePublished": "2021-04-05T14:06:14.633Z"
          },
          {
