            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BLZeebub"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is the new go-to ham glaze in our house. Lovely, complex and so simple to make. The molasses gives that earthy back of the tongue pleasure while all the other spices add to the symphony in your mouth. Ham never had it so good!",
            "datePublished": "2019-11-29T00:18:30.957Z"
          },
