            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lee Littsen Jr"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is so good!! I made it exactly as stated except I didn't have brown sugar used Morena un refined pure sugar and halved the recipe as I only had half a cup of the molasses. heated it on the stove to dissolve the sugar. I've made many a ham glaze in my 63 year's this is now my go to recipe. just upped the temperature to finish can't wait till it's done.",
